{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id288214068"}, "name":{"label":"anotherunnecessaryopinion"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T13:40:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"14683031583"}, "title":{"label":"Please Add Serving Size Adjustment"}, "content":{"label":"When using the website on my mobile browser, I don't have the option to see my saved recipes. This is the only reason I downloaded the app. I can access my saves here, but I can't adjust the serving size without going back to the browser and doing it there. So basically, I'm using both when everything could be in one place.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id213830892"}, "name":{"label":"Tess Urdu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-17T13:50:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"14678996300"}, "title":{"label":"Where are my collections!?"}, "content":{"label":"This is the most confusing app I’ve ever used. Can’t find my collections. I don’t remember the exact name of each recipe so I can’t individually search for them. I’ve lost dozens and dozens of my favorite recipes. You really let us down!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id229265155"}, "name":{"label":"DeekGeek"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-17T11:00:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"14678482386"}, "title":{"label":"Just use the web"}, "content":{"label":"The best way to describe this app is the way it does collections: I go to my “Saves” and it shows the first few categories, just like the web. I tap “Load more”, just like the web. The app then shows that I have no collections and no recipes. None. I reload. Same thing. I force close the app and reload. Same thing. So, between the lack of functionality in the app and the presence of an ad blocker in my browser, I’ll just use the web.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1315184026"}, "name":{"label":"Done with MyRecipes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-16T05:27:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"14673244273"}, "title":{"label":"Ruined a Good Thing"}, "content":{"label":"Had an account on AllRecipes for years without any problems. Then MyRecipes comes along. At first I thought it was great, accessed other recipe sites, etc. Then along comes the MyRecipes app. Was difficult to navigate at first, but eventually figured it out. Until now. Cannot navigate what I can’t sign in to. Keep getting a File 403 message. App will not let me sign in. Cannot access Help tabs because the App will not open. I have around 500 recipes saved that I cannot access. This App is useless to me. I also cannot delete my account because I cannot access the App. Wish you had left well enough alone with AllRecipes. My Recipes is not getting it done.  It appears I’m not the only one. If you reply to this don’t bother telling me to use the Help function. I can’t access the app to open anything up.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id460330441"}, "name":{"label":"SCAMMED.2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-13T22:12:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"14664349607"}, "title":{"label":"error code 403"}, "content":{"label":"I tried to use this app but I was never able to sign in, I kept getting error code 403. I researched support and the website and could not find error code 403.  I just deleted it", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id222491515"}, "name":{"label":"groceryexpert"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-11T18:31:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"14656005149"}, "title":{"label":"Life changing for our house"}, "content":{"label":"I absolutely love this app. It has saved us from a lot of frustration. It nice that you cam type in an specific ingredient that you have on hand and see what you can make with it, without getting overwhelmed by the internet results. \n\nI do wish for the recipe search (not saved) there would be a short list of search history and recently viewed. \nIt would be helpful for when I am in the middle of researching for recipes and have to put my phone down. When i pick up the app again, it refreshes after being away for some time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1290081981"}, "name":{"label":"cathypaola"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-10T16:54:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"14651700402"}, "title":{"label":"My Recipes = wow! Free! Fun! So many recipes! So much possibilities!"}, "content":{"label":"Wow, wow wow! I am a young entrepreneur and I want to start a cookie business! MyRecipes has a bunch of way cool cookie, cupcake, and no bake recipes! Double cool! I love!!!!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id217760173"}, "name":{"label":"SM Suhr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-06T17:18:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"14636243677"}, "title":{"label":"MyRecipes App 2.0"}, "content":{"label":"If you’ve been around for more than a few years, you know that MyRecipes already HAD an app, and I, like many others, loved it, and paid for the “Lifetime Subscription”. Then, a couple of years ago,  they took down the app and when we complained, they said, “Tough Luck, we aren’t doing an app anymore.” \nNow, lo and behold, they made a new app, but now there are only monthly and annual subscription options, so I guess it’s still, “Tough Luck. We already got your money and there’s nothing you can do about it.”\nWell, I’m not giving them another red cent, because they can’t be trusted to keep their agreements.\nLifetime, my eye.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id39523317"}, "name":{"label":"countrygirl5687"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-04T12:18:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"14627927647"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t see the different companies articles or recipes"}, "content":{"label":"I though I would be able to browse Food and Wine recipes such as the articles posted on Facebook, or select search southern living recipes, but you can’t search by the different companies/collections so you can see the latest recipes by Food and Wine, etc.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
