{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1973316610"}, "name":{"label":"Vercant"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-27T05:57:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"14599440091"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t go full screen on an iPad?!"}, "content":{"label":"Why do I want to try and read a recipe on only a third of my iPad screen? I’d much rather go to a website than try and use this on here. Can’t find and save all my favorites on the website anymore though so now I can only use this?! Make this available to fill in the entire IPad screen and we’d have a much better experience. I miss the Allrecipes dinner spinner app. That was so much better than this.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id102834989"}, "name":{"label":"Bradley Clark"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-25T11:24:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"14592676251"}, "title":{"label":"Reviews are hidden"}, "content":{"label":"You can’t read the reviews in the app. I found the user tips and suggestions often improved recipes significantly. You have to scroll down to “View Recipe on the Web” to take you to the full recipe details. \nIf I have to do that why use the app in the first place? Consumer Reports did the same thing, making their app a summary of their product reviews, often leaving out critical decision making information. Hated that too.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id223352126"}, "name":{"label":"k_salesky"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-24T18:48:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"14589927897"}, "title":{"label":"No responsive development for tablets?"}, "content":{"label":"I pretty much exclusively use my iPad to display my recipes while cooking. Using my browser to view my saved recipes on allrecipes.com had always worked for me. Now I am forced to download this app and the developers couldn’t include responsive screen sizes for tablets? I’d love to use my whole screen instead of 1/3 of it. The app is easy to use so I give 3 stars but please please include a full wide screen version for tablets.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id137209895"}, "name":{"label":"AZSHARCLAN"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-24T08:43:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"14588280062"}, "title":{"label":"Don’t waste your time.  Doesn’t work."}, "content":{"label":"This app, MyRecipes, doesn’t work on my iPhone. It provides me a 403 error message with no further information. I had such high hopes to have all of the recipes in one spot that was easily accessible. Unfortunately this new app is not working out and will be deleted. \n\nIt is a new app, so I will try again in a few months maybe if I remember to. \n\nDon’t waste your time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
