{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id25608316"}, "name":{"label":"Sassiebrat"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-07T03:12:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14520832582"}, "title":{"label":"It’s free until you try to import"}, "content":{"label":"I thought this was going to be great… I can’t afford to pay for it but I’m willing to deal with ads… but when I tried to save a recipe from social media I was shown the screen where it says importing… then it said the connection was interrupted… I tried 3 times… getting the same error… only there was no interruption… I never lost cell or WiFi… so is importing from social media only available if you pay?? I don’t recall seeing anything that stated that", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1522078108"}, "name":{"label":"BOGO904"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-03T07:02:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14505803008"}, "title":{"label":"Mobile Web and App Not Syncing"}, "content":{"label":"For the most part, the experience is fine but when I try to save recipes within the app, the collection feature doesn’t appear to be synced to the web application account I created. So when I try to create a new collection in the app, it says that it already exists but the collection doesn’t show in my list of collections for me to select and save the recipe.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
