{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id106148630"}, "name":{"label":"Wife and Mom"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-31T10:34:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14494708200"}, "title":{"label":"I Had High Hopes"}, "content":{"label":"When I saw that My Recipes was creating an app for saved recipes for the home cook, I was excited.  Alas, not anymore.  I downloaded it to my iPad and proceeded to try out the free version.  (The full version is $39.99 and then there are in app purchases.  Very pricey.)  The app is very slow, it is clunky, and it has already frozen. I guess I’ll go back to printing out the recipes that look good and work on a paper index to sort and label them. Very disappointed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6755009073&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
